{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player game with a light Greek mythology theme that has over 250 cards to collect by defeating enemy hordes with superior tactics and well timed sorceries. You can also unlock 40 different deck types with their own particular strategy and many card combo's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight For Olympus works different than most other deckbuilding card games:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-more tactics moving from positions for lane based, turn based combat;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-retention of both cards in hand and resources, allowing to save up;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-more synergy and combo's;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-unlockable decktypes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is for those that enjoy to keep finding new ways to exploit certain cards.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940050?t=1773327096","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940050/b18bed1c0d25959cde6f5cc2f8f207e91a66021a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773327096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940050/8578a551074a6c619733cd452bc301e0789826b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773327096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940050/8578a551074a6c619733cd452bc301e0789826b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773327096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4241110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player game with a light Greek mythology theme that has over 250 cards to collect by defeatin